{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>32歲「億萬駙馬」伍富橋與富貴妻子梁兆楹提早迎來愛子，日前更於西貢5,000呎豪宅舉行盛大滿月宴。榮升新手父母本應喜氣洋洋，豈料太太深夜卻於社交平台大爆湊仔崩潰內幕。這段豪門育兒生活背後竟然暗藏鮮為人知震撼辛酸。</p>\n<h2>伍富橋西貢獨立屋設滿月宴大搞封酒儀式</h2>\n<p>伍富橋與梁兆楹於日前在西貢相思灣高達5,000呎獨立屋庭園內筵開三席，現場掛滿傳統紅燈籠並擺放大量金器及酸薑涼果，充滿喜慶氣氛。滿月宴最特別環節是即場封存多支名酒，寓意留待愛兒成年或遇上人生重要時刻才正式開封。剛足月嬰孩面頰飽滿非常精靈，熟睡時更不經意擺出拉丁舞手勢，似乎完美繼承父親優良跳舞基因。</p>\n<h2>富貴妻梁兆楹深夜大吐苦水爆老公換衫極慢</h2>\n<p>面對日夜顛倒育兒生活，梁兆楹昨日於社交平台首度公開愛兒正面照，更抵死地將兒子形容為「最新款四腳吞金獸」。她大爆愛兒充電極慢但續航力短，內置每四小時狂響高分貝鬧鐘，直言「半夜有佢比tequila上頭更快」。除了大呻疲倦，她亦公開指控伍富橋幫囝囝換衫時手腳極慢，搞到急性子兒子等到激動狂扯自己頭髮抗議，場面相當惹笑。</p>\n<h2>伍富橋提早做老竇愛犬化身保鑣嚴密監視</h2>\n<p>其實早在本月中出席公開活動時，伍富橋已突發宣布愛妻提早近一個月誕下愛情結晶品。雖然BB心急提早報到，但產婦復原力驚人，坐月未足一個月已回復狀態並出關暢飲。自從新生命降臨後，家中不僅兩夫妻生活迎來巨變，連愛犬Pickle亦化身超級金牌監工。每當男主人親自湊BB時，狗狗必定寸步不離並擺出極度嚴肅表情，全程嚴密監視生怕小主人受傷。</p>\n<h2>網民熱議億萬駙馬幸福日常羨慕愛犬極具靈性</h2>\n<p>夫妻兩人連日來高調分享苦中帶甜湊仔點滴，成功吸引大批網民關注及熱烈討論。不少人留言大讚BB熟睡模樣相當可愛，紛紛表示「瞓覺都識跳舞真係好有遺傳天份」，亦有人對狗狗護主行為感到心甜，留言直指「毛孩真係好有靈性」、「狗狗做埋保鑣好盡責」。大批網民湧入留言區送上真摯祝福，並大讚一家三口連同愛犬相處畫面極度溫馨。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/17932687764788221_7136807766ae31c29172b7.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"bkn-20261028190113307-1028_00862_001_08b.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/17932687764788221_7136807766ae31c29172b7.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@sysleungx）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179326877785870716_12532912926ae31c2a437a3.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"bkn-20261028190113307-1028_00862_001_10b.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179326877785870716_12532912926ae31c2a437a3.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@sysleungx）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179326877905067541_10233898636ae31c2b6d2f3.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"bkn-20261028190113307-1028_00862_001_09b.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179326877905067541_10233898636ae31c2b6d2f3.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@sysleungx）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178823974141049305_15830439546a965f7db756c.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"sysleungx_1788172801_3975691721341262669_6235759.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178823974141049305_15830439546a965f7db756c.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@sysleungx）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178823975001273333_9376538086a965f868e073.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"伍富橋老婆 梁兆楹 （圖片來源：Instagram@sysleungx）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178823975001273333_9376538086a965f868e073.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：Instagram@sysleungx）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/17866778726125916_2078593176a7e8a70da76a.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/17866778726125916_2078593176a7e8a70da76a.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@alvinngfukiu）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T10:21:45.799786+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1154,"images":6,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T10:13:07+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T10:58:36.494661+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T10:18:34.595094+00:00","content_hash":"837befce448e7f4f4ad03a55163b329014a49ea4ee4886e4ac8f5a4d6184ce01","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}